---
const gumroadUrl = "https://atkmusic.gumroad.com/l/mon-premier-home-studio";
const title = "Mon Premier Home Studio | Guide ATK Music";
const description = "Monte ton premier home studio et commence à enregistrer chez toi sans gaspiller ton argent dans du matériel inutile.";
const canonical = "https://atkmusic.fr/ebook/";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />

    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:locale" content="fr_FR" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="ATK Music" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Manrope:wght@700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #06050a;
        --panel: #11101a;
        --panel-2: #181529;
        --ink: #f7f3ff;
        --muted: #b9aecb;
        --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
        --purple: #8b5cf6;
        --blue: #6d7dff;
        --white: #ffffff;
        --max: 1120px;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { background: var(--bg); scroll-behavior: smooth; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.32), transparent 34rem),
          radial-gradient(circle at 85% 18%, rgba(109, 125, 255, 0.22), transparent 30rem),
          linear-gradient(180deg, #06050a 0%, #0b0912 58%, #06050a 100%);
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
      img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
      .wrap { width: min(var(--max), calc(100% - 32px)); margin: 0 auto; }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 18px;
        padding: 22px 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.83rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--white); }
      .brand__mark {
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        font-weight: 900;
      }

      .nav__link { color: var(--muted); }
      .nav__link:hover { color: var(--white); }

      .hero {
        min-height: calc(100svh - 84px);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(280px, 0.72fr);
        gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 72px);
        align-items: center;
        padding: clamp(42px, 7vw, 92px) 0;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        padding: 9px 12px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: #d9d2ff;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple), var(--blue)); }

      h1, h2, h3 { font-family: Manrope, Inter, sans-serif; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.055em; }
      h1 {
        max-width: 820px;
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 7.5rem);
        line-height: 0.88;
        text-wrap: balance;
      }
      .gradient { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff, #bba7ff 48%, #89a1ff); -webkit-background-clip: text; color: transparent; }

      .lead {
        max-width: 650px;
        margin: 28px 0 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 34px; }
      .button {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 54px;
        padding: 0 22px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      .button--primary { background: var(--white); color: #080711; }
      .button--ghost { border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045); }
      .button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

      .card {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 30px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.11), rgba(255,255,255,0.035));
        box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.34);
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .book {
        min-height: 520px;
        padding: 34px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at 74% 18%, rgba(139,92,246,.42), transparent 15rem),
          linear-gradient(145deg, #11101c, #08070e 58%, #161334);
      }
      .book__top { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .book__title { margin-top: 56px; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.25rem); line-height: .9; }
      .book__line { width: 90px; height: 5px; margin: 28px 0; border-radius: 99px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--purple), var(--blue)); }
      .book__bottom { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.45; font-weight: 700; }

      section { padding: clamp(52px, 7vw, 92px) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .section-head { max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
      h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5.2vw, 4.6rem); line-height: .95; }
      .section-head p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; }

      .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
      .mini {
        padding: 24px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 22px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
      }
      .mini h3 { font-size: 1.12rem; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin-bottom: 10px; }
      .mini p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; }

      .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr; gap: 22px; align-items: start; }
      .list {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .list li {
        padding: 18px 18px 18px 48px;
        position: relative;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .list li::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 18px;
        top: 23px;
        width: 11px;
        height: 11px;
        border-radius: 99px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple), var(--blue));
      }
      .list strong { color: var(--white); }

      .final { text-align: center; padding-bottom: 100px; }
      .final .lead { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

      @media (max-width: 860px) {
        .hero, .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .hero { min-height: 0; padding-top: 26px; }
        .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .book { min-height: 430px; }
        .nav { align-items: flex-start; }
        .nav__link { display: none; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="wrap nav" aria-label="Navigation">
      <a class="brand" href="/ebook/" aria-label="ATK Music — Mon Premier Home Studio">
        <span class="brand__mark">ATK</span>
        <span>ATK Music</span>
      </a>
      <a class="nav__link" href="/lavision/">Portfolio</a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <div class="wrap hero">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Guide PDF pour artistes débutants</div>
          <h1>Mon Premier <span class="gradient">Home Studio</span></h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Monte ton premier studio et commence à enregistrer chez toi sans gaspiller ton argent dans du matériel inutile.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a class="button button--primary" href={gumroadUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Voir le guide sur Gumroad</a>
            <a class="button button--ghost" href="#contenu">Ce qu’il y a dedans</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="card" aria-label="Couverture stylisée du guide">
          <div class="book">
            <div class="book__top">ATK Music · Ebook PDF</div>
            <div>
              <div class="book__title">Mon Premier<br />Home Studio</div>
              <div class="book__line"></div>
              <div class="book__bottom">Commencer à enregistrer proprement sans acheter le studio de quelqu’un d’autre.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <section id="contenu">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2>Pas un guide pour acheter plus. Un guide pour commencer mieux.</h2>
            <p>
              L’objectif est simple : comprendre ce qu’il te faut vraiment, ce que tu peux garder pour plus tard, et comment faire une première prise exploitable chez toi.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid">
            <article class="mini">
              <h3>Matériel utile</h3>
              <p>Micro, interface audio, casque, câbles, pied, anti-pop : quoi acheter, quoi éviter, et dans quel ordre.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="mini">
              <h3>Installation claire</h3>
              <p>Comment brancher ton setup, régler ton logiciel, gérer la latence et éviter les prises qui saturent.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="mini">
              <h3>Budgets réalistes</h3>
              <p>Des configurations cohérentes autour de 300–350 €, 500 € et 1 000 €, sans remplir le panier pour rien.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="wrap split">
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2>Pour qui ?</h2>
            <p>Artistes, chanteurs, rappeurs et producteurs qui veulent enregistrer chez eux sans se perdre dans dix heures de vidéos contradictoires.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="list">
            <li><strong>Tu débutes</strong> et tu ne sais pas quoi acheter en premier.</li>
            <li><strong>Tu as déjà un peu de matériel</strong> mais tu ne sais pas s’il te limite vraiment.</li>
            <li><strong>Tu veux enregistrer des voix</strong> propres avant de penser studio parfait.</li>
            <li><strong>Tu veux éviter les achats inutiles</strong> : plugins, enceintes, mousses, bundles mal choisis.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="final">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Phrase centrale du guide</div>
          <h2>Tu n’as pas besoin d’acheter le studio de la personne que tu voudrais devenir.</h2>
          <p class="lead">Apprends d’abord à exploiter celui que tu as aujourd’hui.</p>
          <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:center">
            <a class="button button--primary" href={gumroadUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Acheter / voir sur Gumroad</a>
            <a class="button button--ghost" href="/lavision/">Voir le portfolio ATK</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
